Hillium
Copyright (c) 2026 Lucas Van De Weerd. MIT, see LICENSE.

Hillium is an Arc and Zen style browser built on Electron, with Helium's privacy
defaults. It is not affiliated with The Browser Company (Arc, Dia), the Zen Browser
project, imputnet (Helium), Brave, Vivaldi, Ghostery, Google or Microsoft. "Arc",
"Zen", "Helium" and the other names here are their owners' trademarks and are used
only to describe where ideas came from.

Arc is closed source. Nothing from Arc's app was decompiled, copied or reused:
Hillium's Arc-style features are rebuilt from how Arc behaves in public, and its Arc
importer reads the user's own StorableSidebar.json, read-only.

